        "type": "paragraph",
        "paragraph": {
          "rich_text": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": {
                "content": "SDIndex is a deployable fieldwork protocol for encoding embodied spatial perception as structured data. It measures five dimensions of how built environments act on the body in situ: material / cultural density, luminosity behaviour, spatial restraint, geometric enclosure, and temporal-emotional valence. Each dimension is recorded on a 0–10 scale at the moment of encounter, before interpretation.",
                "link": null
              },
              "annotations": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "strikethrough": false,
                "underline": false,
                "code": false,
                "color": "default"
              },
              "plain_text": "SDIndex is a deployable fieldwork protocol for encoding embodied spatial perception as structured data. It measures five dimensions of how built environments act on the body in situ: material / cultural density, luminosity behaviour, spatial restraint, geometric enclosure, and temporal-emotional valence. Each dimension is recorded on a 0–10 scale at the moment of encounter, before interpretation.",
              "href": null
            }
          ],
          "icon": null,
          "color": "default"
        },
        "archived": false
      },
      {
        "object": "block",
        "id": "33f18eed-3014-80da-8afb-cde7f3b2c7b7",
        "parent": {
          "type": "page_id",
          "page_id": "33f18eed-3014-80fa-9663-ecbb41854e18"
        },
        "created_time": "2026-04-11T10:29:00.000Z",
        "last_edited_time": "2026-04-11T10:29:00.000Z",
        "created_by": {
          "object": "user",
          "id": "166d872b-594c-8143-b1f3-00028c60686a"
        },
        "last_edited_by": {
          "object": "user",
          "id": "166d872b-594c-8143-b1f3-00028c60686a"
        },
        "has_children": false,
        "in_trash": false,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "paragraph": {
          "rich_text": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": {
                "content": "The protocol is designed to preserve the integrity of first-contact perception. All records follow a three-layer architecture: raw measurement, semantic annotation, and narrative field notes. These layers are governed by a non-contamination principle: primary scores recorded on site are never retroactively altered by later reflection.",
                "link": null
              },
              "annotations": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "strikethrough": false,
                "underline": false,
                "code": false,
                "color": "default"
              },
              "plain_text": "The protocol is designed to preserve the integrity of first-contact perception. All records follow a three-layer architecture: raw measurement, semantic annotation, and narrative field notes. These layers are governed by a non-contamination principle: primary scores recorded on site are never retroactively altered by later reflection.",
              "href": null
            }
          ],
          "icon": null,
          "color": "default"
        },
        "archived": false
      },
      {
        "object": "block",
        "id": "33f18eed-3014-80ab-8f52-e65638bbd2c1",
        "parent": {
          "type": "page_id",
          "page_id": "33f18eed-3014-80fa-9663-ecbb41854e18"
        },
        "created_time": "2026-04-11T10:29:00.000Z",
        "last_edited_time": "2026-04-11T10:29:00.000Z",
        "created_by": {
          "object": "user",
          "id": "166d872b-594c-8143-b1f3-00028c60686a"
        },
        "last_edited_by": {
          "object": "user",
          "id": "166d872b-594c-8143-b1f3-00028c60686a"
        },
        "has_children": false,
        "in_trash": false,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "paragraph": {
          "rich_text": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": {
                "content": "To improve reliability, SDIndex uses differential calibration (Δ logic). The same site may be recorded repeatedly across time and conditions to distinguish stable spatial signals from observer-dependent variation. In selected cases, a minimal parallel form (Observer B) is deployed to a second observer in the same place at the same time. Per-dimension delta analysis helps identify where different bodies converge under the same spatial pressure, and where interpretation diverges.",
                "link": null
              },
              "annotations": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "strikethrough": false,
                "underline": false,
                "code": false,
                "color": "default"
              },
              "plain_text": "To improve reliability, SDIndex uses differential calibration (Δ logic). The same site may be recorded repeatedly across time and conditions to distinguish stable spatial signals from observer-dependent variation. In selected cases, a minimal parallel form (Observer B) is deployed to a second observer in the same place at the same time. Per-dimension delta analysis helps identify where different bodies converge under the same spatial pressure, and where interpretation diverges.",
              "href": null
            }
          ],
          "icon": null,
          "color": "default"
        },
        "archived": false
      },
      {
        "object": "block",
        "id": "33f18eed-3014-80a7-bfd6-faadccf449cf",
        "parent": {
          "type": "page_id",
          "page_id": "33f18eed-3014-80fa-9663-ecbb41854e18"
        },
        "created_time": "2026-04-11T10:29:00.000Z",
        "last_edited_time": "2026-04-11T10:29:00.000Z",
        "created_by": {
          "object": "user",
